                    description: Some("This parameter is only supported for portfolios with an OrganizationalNode Type of ORGANIZATION or ORGANIZATIONAL_UNIT.  Enables or disables Principal sharing when creating the portfolio share. If you do not provide this flag, principal sharing is disabled.  When you enable Principal Name Sharing for a portfolio share, the share recipient account end users with a principal that matches any of the associated IAM patterns can provision products from the portfolio. Once shared, the share recipient can view associations of PrincipalType: IAM_PATTERN on their portfolio. You can create the principals in the recipient account before or after creating the share"),
